From 143ab53ec902933918f2a9f7700d4f50cbc4218c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:20:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands to run through backend
 command execution

Route slash-style selected-agent chat input through the provider command hook so Codex resumes receive raw command stdin instead of prompt-wrapped text, while normal chat messages keep the existing send/orchestrator path.
